refentry.refsect1:
&reftitle.errors;


 Throws RdKafka\KafkaErrorException if librdkafka cannot start closing the consumer, for example after a fatal error. The consumer then stays open.



 Throws RdKafka\Exception when called from a callback while RdKafka\KafkaConsumer::close is running.

  &reftitle.examples;

   RdKafka\KafkaConsumer::closeAsync example


<?php
$consumer->closeAsync();

while (!$consumer->isClosed()) {
    $message = $consumer->consume(50);
    // Handle any message or error that is still returned.
}

$consumer->close();
?>
